OL,3,GNEWSAMother and son on trial over fatal
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who stabbed her partner in the
OL,7,Fchest with a kitchen knife has gone on
OL,8,Ftrial accused of his murder.
OL,10,FKarol Likiera, 41, was pronounced dead
OL,11,Fafter emergency crews were called to a
OL,12,Fground floor flat in Algitha Road,
OL,13,FSkegness, on the morning of 18 August
OL,14,F2025.
OL,16,FSylwia Bukala, 43, admits stabbing
OL,17,FLikiera but denies murder, claiming
OL,18,Fdiminished responsibility because of
OL,19,Fher mental state, Lincoln Crown Court
OL,20,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
